proxy headers (sent upstream):
  X-Forwarded-Host: $http_host -> UNRESOLVED (this variable is outside the dry-run's knowledge)
  X-Real-IP: $remote_addr -> UNRESOLVED (the client address; pass --client to supply one)
  X-Forwarded-Proto: $scheme -> UNRESOLVED (this variable is outside the dry-run's knowledge)
decision: would proxy to http://127.0.0.1:8001/
